cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this code, cite the libwebm fork it is vendored from.
title: libwebm (vendored)
abstract: >-
  The WebM project's Matroska/WebM muxer and parser (mkvmuxer, mkvparser), added
  here as a squashed git subtree of the V-Sekai-fire fork at commit 6184f44 (main).
  tools/av1mkv compiles mkvmuxer/mkvmuxer.cc, mkvmuxerutil.cc, mkvwriter.cc,
  mkvparser/mkvparser.cc and mkvreader.cc straight into its executable (its own CMake is
  not used) to write V_AV1 plus A_PCM/INT/LIT Matroska and to read it back for
  verification. No source is modified.
type: software
authors:
  - name: The WebM Project Authors
  - name: V-Sekai
repository-code: https://github.com/V-Sekai-fire/libwebm
